<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Well, you know how it feels when you need a drink?</l><l>Oh, you thirst! Well, then don’t let your body sink!</l><l>The majority that composes me:</l><l>Yes, it’s water, chemically (H2O, you know)!</l><l>It freezes to ice, which is very nice!</l><l>And dissolves: lemonade, tea and Gatorade!</l><l>What a great plan, Lord, that You made it so:</l><l>Water flows and goes and flows and goes!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
